        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 18EFBZ, 18 Inch Flush Bolt with Flip Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana 18\" extension flush boltl (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and have a flip style lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. Packaged complete with flush bolt, matching finish screws and <a href=\"/products/strike-plate-for-flush-bolt-deltana-sp7fbr\">strike plate</a>. Available in 5 different finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-18EFBZ_size.gif?v=1704354595\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 18EFBZ 18 Inch Flush Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Here are some other size Flush Bolts we carry:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-4fbs\">4\" Square Corners</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-del-6fbs\">6\" Square Corners</a>  -  \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-round-corners-deltana-del-6fbr\">6\" Round Corners</a> - <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-7-inch-flush-bolt-deltana-7fbr\">7\" Heavy Duty</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-extension-flush-bolts-12-18-and-24-inches-deltana-del-efb\">Extension Flush Bolts in 12\", 18\", 24\"</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 18\" flush bolt is builder's grade cast zinc. Fits most of the standard T-Astragal prepped for rounded corner extension flush bolts.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana 18EFBZ Flush Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Length: 7-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Depth: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Corners: Round</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Thickness: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/18EFBZ.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 18EFBZ Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
