                "description": "Deltana 18EFBZ - This Deltana 18 Inch extension flush bolt (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and have a flip style lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. Packaged complete with flush bolt, matching finish screws and strike plate. Available in 5 different finishes. ",
